<title>UK: Asset Backed Capital adds $100 mln to Oct bond.</title>
<headline>Asset Backed Capital adds $100 mln to Oct bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASSET BACKED CAPITAL LTD.</p>
<p> AMT   *$100 MLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    22.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.604   PAY DATE  **28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.4165  SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH $250 MILLION LAUNCHED 01.OCT.96</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 96 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     N.Y</p>
<p> TAX PROVS  STD	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100 SALE LIMS JP/US/UK/CAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
